ent wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Purpose\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Purpose</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Fighting Blood Moon Enemies/Getting Exclusive Blood Moon Items</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.68.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">October 4th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p><i><big>\"A blood moon is rising... Find enemies around the map and fight!\"</big></i>\n</p><p>The <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Blood Moon</strong> is an event taking place during Halloween. It can appear any night. During the <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Blood Moon</strong>, unusual structures appear in 3 places: in the center of The <span class=\"new\" title=\"Farlands (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRmFybGFuZHM/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Farlands</span> (near <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">The Lighthouse</a>), The Taiga (behind <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a>), and in The Savannah. The following monsters appear in these structures: Zombies, Skeletons, Pumpkin Zombies, Sword Skeletons, Vampires, Werewolves, Gremlins, and Headless Horsemen (not to be confused with the salesman). The duration of this event lasts 5 in-game hours, or 5 minutes in real life.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Monsters\">Monsters</span></h2>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Drop\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Zombie\" title=\"Zombie\">Zombie</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Bone\" title=\"Bone\">Bone</a>, 1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Candycorn\" title=\"Candycorn\">Candycorn</a>, 30-50% <a href=\"/wiki/Zombie_Head\" title=\"Zombie Head\">Zombie Head</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Skeleton\" title=\"Skeleton\">Skeleton</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Bone\" title=\"Bone\">Bone</a>, 1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Candycorn\" title=\"Candycorn\">Candycorn</a>, 20-40% <a href=\"/wiki/Skull\" title=\"Skull\">Skull</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Vampires\" title=\"Vampires\">Vampires</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Bone\" title=\"Bone\">Bone</a>, 1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Candycorn\" title=\"Candycorn\">Candycorn</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Meat_Vinyl_Player\" title=\"Meat Vinyl Player\">Meat Vinyl Player</a>, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Stake (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU3Rha2U/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">stake</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Werewolf\" title=\"Werewolf\">Werewolf</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Bone\" title=\"Bone\">Bone</a>, 1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Candycorn\" title=\"Candycorn\">Candycorn</a>, 1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Moon_Shard\" title=\"Moon Shard\">Moon Shard</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Gremlins\" title=\"Gremlins\">Gremlins</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>5-6 <a href=\"/wiki/Greeb\" title=\"Greeb\">Greeb</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Pumpkinhead\" title=\"Pumpkinhead\">Pumpkinhead</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Bone\" title=\"Bone\">Bone</a>, 1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Candycorn\" title=\"Candycorn\">Candycorn</a>, 2-5 <a href=\"/wiki/Pumpkin\" title=\"Pumpkin\">Pumpkin</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Headless_Horseman\" title=\"Headless Horseman\">Headless Horseman</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Bone\" title=\"Bone\">Bone</a>, 1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Candycorn\" title=\"Candycorn\">Candycorn</a>, 2-4 <a href=\"/wiki/Pumpkin\" title=\"Pumpkin\">Pumpkin</a>, 5% <a href=\"/wiki/Bodyless_Horse\" title=\"Bodyless Horse\">Bodyless Horse</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>If a Skeleton is holding a <a href=\"/wiki/Linked_Sword\" title=\"Linked Sword\">Linked Sword</a>, then there is a 90% chance it will fall out after death.</li>\n<li>If a Zombie is wearing a <a href=\"/wiki/Pumpkin\" title=\"Pumpkin\">Pumpkin</a>, it will fall out after death.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902161702\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 82/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 64/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019438/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   28.803      1 Template:Buildings\n100.00%   28.803      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3390-0